    "summary": "Some units’ rules say that when an **attached unit**’s bodyguard unit is **destroyed**, its Leader and Support units each become a unit of their own, at their original **starting strengths**.\n\nEven so, when such a bodyguard unit is destroyed, all those Leader and Support units stay one unit for every rule.",
